Run `M8_maxent_softmax_policy.py`. It performs four reproducible experiments:


1. solves the MaxEnt die problem with mean $4.5$;

2. compares truncated-geometric and binomial distributions under one mean constraint;

3. numerically verifies the softmax variational formula;

4. traces regularization strength for an intentionally misspecified proxy reward containing a reward-hacking action.

Explain why the last experiment demonstrates a **possibility**, not a universal inevitability of true-quality degradation.
